  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9352253bc69f1c8",
      "translationZh": "我最近将工作站升级为 2x 5070 ti，以便运行 Qwen 3.8 27B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8adf13d1a5e00240",
      "translationZh": "我让 opus 4.6 帮忙配置，并对比了 vLLM、llama.cpp 和 wamansou/ninfer-tp2-1m，后者是 https://github.com/Neroued/ninfer 的一个分支，可以在 2 块 GPU 上运行。Ninfer 只提到 5090 可以正常运行，但我在自己的 2x 5070 ti 上测试过，无需任何修改就能完美运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38f9d5b20d6f4c4b",
      "translationZh": "我花了一天时间，在双 RTX 5070 Ti 显卡上对 Qwen3.8-27B 在三种推理引擎中的表现进行了基准测试。由于目前关于这种 GPU 组合的数据不多，我分享一下测试结果，而且测试过程中也有一些意外发现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "452c2539846da6ef",
      "translationZh": "GPU：2× RTX 5070 Ti 16GB（sm_120，Blackwell），PCIe 4.0 x8/x8（BIOS 拆分）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "494a49742065f6d3",
      "translationZh": "主板：ASRock B550M Steel Legend",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37a7042b1e3703e5",
      "translationZh": "无 P2P——PHB 拓扑，所有多 GPU 通信均通过主机内存中转复制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37d160804215c1a9",
      "translationZh": "操作系统：Ubuntu 26.04，CUDA 13.3（NVIDIA 软件仓库），驱动：595.84",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eaec0eb45a502e53",
      "translationZh": "引擎 量化 大小 最大上下文 解码 tok/s（MTP3） 原始解码（无 MTP）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6dd8b5cc196502d",
      "translationZh": "使用 MTP3 时，三个引擎都处于约 100-115 tok/s 的范围内。真正的区别在于上下文窗口和配置复杂度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "76bde5340724db0b",
      "translationZh": "llama-bench 标准基准测试（无推测解码）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25a5a2bfb323b2d8",
      "translationZh": "构建时使用了 GGML_CUDA=ON GGML_CUDA_FA=ON GGML_CUDA_NCCL=ON CMAKE_CUDA_ARCHITECTURES=120。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b00a70b774f29469",
      "translationZh": "模型：unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF Q4_K_XL（17.6 GB）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af3653f1f988218c",
      "translationZh": "2× GPU 张量拆分（-sm tensor）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b46ed63d1dba5652",
      "translationZh": "使用 MTP3 推测解码（--spec-type draft-mtp --spec-draft-n-max 3，使用同一仓库中的独立 MTP GGUF）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cbc81f29733b5f8",
      "translationZh": "上下文 解码 tok/s MTP 接受率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33de21a5f68c8b7e",
      "translationZh": "最大上下文：使用 q8_0 KV 缓存时为 226k，作为服务器运行时为 220k。使用 f16 KV 时为 185k。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86150fe9f22cd5b6",
      "translationZh": "模型：unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4（21 GB）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "405332981db4091f",
      "translationZh": "最大的教训：--enforce-eager 在 Blackwell 上绝对是性能杀手。启用它：9.6 tok/s。不启用它：~110 tok/s。仅一个标志就造成了 11× 的差距。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a6369fc3bfb088b",
      "translationZh": "要让 vLLM 在 2×16GB 上运行，必须使用非常特定的标志（感谢 club-5060ti 提供这套配置方案）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a881b2956fbfee32",
      "translationZh": "--max-cudagraph-capture-size 4 — 使用能容纳于 16GB 显存中的微型 CUDA 图",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ebd2add73205fb78",
      "translationZh": "--kv-cache-memory 2500000000 — 明确为每个 GPU 分配 2.5 GB KV 缓存，防止自动调整大小导致 OOM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1fdbec1b454fbc8c",
      "translationZh": "--language-model-only — 跳过视觉编码器，节省显存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0eeb8f47082ad9ec",
      "translationZh": "--disable-custom-all-reduce — 消费级 AMD 上没有 P2P",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4fa7aa01d71c9141",
      "translationZh": "另外：FlashInfer 首次对 NVFP4 CUTLASS 内核进行 JIT 编译时，使用默认并行度会因内存不足而被终止。启动前请设置 MAX_JOBS=1。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee5fa8dd76156bc4",
      "translationZh": "最大上下文：122k（受 16GB 显卡上 CUDA 图捕获开销的限制）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b1af4bb26bea9c2",
      "translationZh": "这是个惊喜。NInfer 是一个从零开始构建、专为 RTX 5090 打造的 C++/CUDA 引擎。README 说仅支持 sm_120a。但 sm_120a 代码在 5070 Ti（sm_120）上运行得非常完美，无需任何修改。只需克隆、构建、运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef271d2cf8a87c32",
      "translationZh": "模型：neroued/Qwen3.8-27B-nvfp4-NInfer 模型产物（21 GB）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d70bef55969f14e",
      "translationZh": "草稿 token 数 解码 tok/s 接受率 每轮 token 数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfda5c961f754b92",
      "translationZh": "MTP3 是最佳平衡点。代码生成提示词也得到了相同的结果——接受率几乎完全一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "525b955b0b0580e9",
      "translationZh": "最大上下文：使用 MTP3 时可达到完整的原生 262k（剩余 138 MiB）。使用 YaRN 且不启用 MTP 时可达到 305k（剩余 5.6 MiB——别真的这样运行）。支持 2 个并发会话，共享一个容量为 256k 的分页 KV 池。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11f8e7b0fe2507e2",
      "translationZh": "注意：NInfer 提供 /v1/chat/completions（而不是 /v1/completions）。TP2 不支持视觉功能（软件限制）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b88ed1d88ca28787",
      "translationZh": "为什么上下文窗口大小存在差异？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3f36f5df6390b2f",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-27B 是一个混合模型——64 层中只有 16 层使用全注意力（每 4 层中的第 4 层）。其余 48 层使用 GDN/线性注意力，没有 KV 缓存。每个注意力层只有 4 个 KV 头，因此 KV 缓存非常小：使用 int8 时约为 16.5 KiB/token。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9e85c2ff3449b68",
      "translationZh": "上下文大小的差异归根结底是因为模型权重占用了显存：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6384bf708e9dc568",
      "translationZh": "llama.cpp Q4_K_XL：约 8.2 GiB/GPU → 留给 KV 的空间更多",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0d3a0329c2df3dc4",
      "translationZh": "NInfer/vLLM NVFP4：约 10.3 GiB/GPU → 剩余空间更少，但 NVFP4 将注意力层保持为 FP8（质量更高）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8da615e9e5dcf00f",
      "translationZh": "NInfer 能达到完整的 262k，是因为其专门设计的分配器比通用引擎的开销更小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ad878b90b413e47c",
      "translationZh": "Ubuntu 26.04 + CUDA：通过 apt 打包提供的 CUDA 13.1 在 glibc 2.43 下无法正常使用（rsqrtf noexcept 冲突）。请改为从 NVIDIA 自己的软件仓库安装 CUDA 13.3。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b6e6cfe6493b7754",
      "translationZh": "vLLM：需要约 15 个精心调优的参数选项。要是没有 club-5060ti 这份参考资料，我早就放弃了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9404700772a13a7c",
      "translationZh": "llama.cpp：直接就能用。构建、下载 GGUF、运行。MTP 草稿头是同一个 HF 仓库中一个独立的 1.4 GB 文件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "47ffc2fc9bc6269f",
      "translationZh": "NInfer：从源码顺利构建，5070 Ti 无需任何补丁，尽管 README 说只支持 5090。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "290f3761eb46f175",
      "translationZh": "对于在 2× 5070 Ti 上进行单用户交互式使用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3948d26c689d12fe",
      "translationZh": "如果你想要简单易用，选 llama.cpp — 115 tok/s、220k 上下文、一行命令",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f9a6e259bc1b3515",
      "translationZh": "如果你想要最大的上下文，选 NInfer — 约 100 tok/s、完整的 262k、并发会话",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "14476db2f557c38e",
      "translationZh": "只有当你明确需要它的服务部署功能时才选 vLLM — 速度相同，但上下文只有一半，配置过程也很折腾",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "fork",
      "briefZh": "项目分支",
      "explanationZh": "从现有项目派生并独立修改的版本，文中指支持双 GPU 运行的派生项目。"
    },
    {
      "term": "inference engines",
      "briefZh": "推理引擎",
      "explanationZh": "加载模型并执行推理计算的软件系统，文中对比了三种引擎的表现。"
    },
    {
      "term": "benchmarking",
